    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31159814c9d2414e",
      "translationZh": "ATX-Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27B-Uncensored-MTP (GGUF) 高精度 i1-Q5_K_M，在消费级 24GB GPU 上支持真实的 131k 上下文",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35b1a474e453f05f",
      "translationZh": "社区中的大多数基准测试仅在微不足道的上下文深度（2k 到 8k token）下测量生成速度。然而，在单张 24GB 消费级 GPU 上，以高量化精度 (Q5_K_M) 运行 27B 参数模型并跨越 131,072 个 token (128k)，且不溢出到缓慢的系统 RAM 或牺牲注意力保真度，是一个本质上不同的挑战。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92332002a24ebf8e",
      "translationZh": "ATX-Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27B-Uncensored-MTP 是一个优化的量化套件，通过专用的校准 imatrix、自定义非对称张量映射以及原生 llamAmpere 硬件加速构建而成。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "668b2e23e20f1e2d",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face 模型卡：https://huggingface.co/bjivanovich/ATX-Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27B-Uncensored-MTP-GGUF",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3865c228582139cd",
      "translationZh": "可用量化版本：i1-Q8_0, i1-Q6_K, i1-Q5_K_M (首选), i1-Q4_K_M，以及用于多模态视觉的 mmproj-BF16.gguf。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "01a4f6967cd2682a",
      "translationZh": "24GB VRAM 上的 131k 上下文与 Q5 精度挑战",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "429ed999e3ef3ea6",
      "translationZh": "在标准 24GB 显卡（RTX 3090 / 4090）上：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "164d04508b584e5d",
      "translationZh": "权重占用：一个标准的 Q5_K_M 精度 27B 模型占用约 19.2 GB 的原始权重。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c999ad407234ed0d",
      "translationZh": "上下文记忆为131,072个标记：标准的FP16 KV缓存用于131k标记本身就需要超过24 GB，使得在不将精度降至严重的Q3/Q2折衷或将层卸载到CPU内存的情况下，完整上下文推理变得不可能。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4aa242629d94ad4a",
      "translationZh": "MTP 量化陷阱：标准社区量化方法会对多令牌预测草稿块（blk.64）进行统一压缩。在 Q5 或 Q4 级别，这会降低草稿的准确性，使投机接受率从 85% 降至约 55%，从而破坏生成速度。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4db219a5ef0f9327",
      "translationZh": "我们的架构：非对称张量映射 + llamAmpere KV 压缩",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f7a4deccf4de0b6",
      "translationZh": "为了解决这个问题，我们采用了在自定义领域丰富数据集（imatrix_atx_uncensored.dat）上校准的非对称逐层量化布局。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    }
  ],
